Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ca-certificates, ffmpeg
Suggests: aria2 | wget | curl, deno | nodejs, python3-brotli, python3-mutagen,
 python3-pycryptodome, python3-secretstorage, python3-websockets
Description: A feature-rich command-line audio/video downloader
 yt-dlp is a feature-rich command-line audio/video downloader with support for
 thousands of sites. It is a fork of youtube-dl based on the now inactive
 youtube-dlc.
 .
 This package ships the official upstream zipapp release, so it is independent
 of the Python modules packaged by the distribution.
